License: MIT, included in src/memfolder/licenses/StreamMeCo-MIT.txt
Implementation: src/memfolder/planning/_streammeco.py and
src/memfolder/planning/streammeco.py

The selection routines preserve the source formulas and class quotas. MemFolder adds graph conversion, protected-record handling, and vector-space checks. This port covers graph compression; the upstream temporal retrieval stage requires a separate reader.

RecordFolder, ContextFolder, and archived methods
-------------------------------------------------

RecordFolder and ContextFolder come from the project authors' standardized
MemFolder-main.zip release. The archived experiments provide text ToMe,
M3 pooled ToMe, the average-linkage MemForest proxy, Random methods, and DART
memory adaptations.

The MemForest tree-based routines and pair prompt come from
11318_MemForest_Efficient_Agen_Supplementary_Material. Release permission for that
archive still needs confirmation from the source. Licensing for the historical
contributions remains under review, and their existing terms continue to apply.

The shared merge, final QA and judge literals are archived MemForest templates.
Their source-file and prompt SHA-256 hashes are recorded in
src/memfolder/prompt_templates.py.

The KMeans stages are implemented in this project and call scikit-learn through an optional dependency.

